            "review_title": "Review at Ngoctrai Restaurant - nha trang",
            "review_text": "nguyễn T\n15 contributions\n0\ndelicious seafood restaurant\nMar 2014 • Family\nThis is one of the most famous restaurant in Nha Trang City because of local price, friendly service, food tasty and runned by the profestional management…You will has chance to enjoy special local foods which are recognized by guests during time live: yelly fish salad in “Ngoc Trai “style, green mango salad with anchovy, sea weed soup,stir –fried bluesea crab in oyster sauce,…. BBQ grouper fish, red snaper,whiter butter fish, jumpoo prawns, tiger prawns, king mussels, rock lobsters, shell, scallop, white mussel, bloody cockels, clams, abalone, toitore,…are displayed in the large glass tanks like a seafood market\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 27, 2014",
